flowchart TB
  Role[房间角色基础权限<br/>creator / admin / member / guest]
  RoomAdd[房间设置<br/>added_permissions]
  RoomRemove[房间设置<br/>removed_permissions]
  MemberAdd[成员个人覆盖<br/>added_permissions]
  MemberRemove[成员个人覆盖<br/>removed_permissions]
  Effective[最终有效权限]
  Creator[creator 特例<br/>始终拥有全部房间权限]

  Role --> RoomAdd --> RoomRemove --> MemberAdd --> MemberRemove --> Effective
  Creator -. 绕过削弱 .-> Effective

  RoomRemove -. 同一权限同时 add/remove 时<br/>remove 生效 .-> Effective
  MemberRemove -. 最后一层覆盖 .-> Effective
